# The smolvm release this crate builds against.
#
# It MUST equal SMOLVM_VERSION in packages/controller/Dockerfile.vm-runner.
# The crate is only half of what the runner needs: the same release supplies
# the agent rootfs and the ext4 disk templates the library reaches for at
# runtime, and a guest agent from one version talking to a library from
# another is not a combination anybody tests. check:pin-matches-image asserts
# the two agree so the pair cannot drift silently.
tag=v1.16.0
